title: Authorizations › New Case › Edge cases and where to see them
route: /authorizations/new
intro: A map of the unusual cases the demo has on purpose, how to reach each, and the diagram that draws what the case does. None of them traps the person: each warns and says what to do next. Only the few conditions on 'What is missing' marked as blocking stop a send.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: member IDs are scripted by their last four digits. Seeded patients keep what their check said. Choose the viewer in the Demo menu; Site B patients are not visible to Dr. Rivera, and Site A patients are not visible to Sam Okafor.
---
start s1 "Pick the edge case to try"
decision d1 "Which one?"

group gLapse "Coverage lapsed"
  process e1 "K.W., 26 (R-1101), Summit, member ID ending 1012: coverage lapsed 10/12\nB.N., 53 (R-0975): coverage ended 09/30\nStart a Retroactive authorization or a renewal for them"
  process e1b "Step 2 shows 'Coverage is not active'\n'Ask the payer, or request retro-eligibility; a retro-authorization can cover the gap.'\nThe person can go on with a documented exception"
endgroup
group gExpiry "An authorization that is ending"
  process e2 "T.R., 29 (I-2207) and L.M., 42 (I-2193), both Site B\nClick 'Start renewal' in the Dashboard's what-to-do list, or pick the type 'Reauthorization / renewal'\n'Expiring soon' with the days or units left"
endgroup
group gNone "Nothing left"
  process e3 "G.W., 50 (R-0902) or J.D., 45 (R-0921, member ID ending 9090), Site A\nPick the type 'Concurrent review' or 'Reauthorization / renewal'\n'None left'\n'No days are left, so the next stretch needs a request now.'"
endgroup
group gPayer "The plan changed"
  process e4 "B.N., 53 (R-0975): Evergreen to Cardinal since 10/01\nOr any member ID ending 7070\n'The payer changed' with 'Switch this case to Cardinal'"
endgroup
group gUnavail "Verification unavailable"
  process e5 "Pause Verify, or Pause all agents, in Settings\nOpen step 2\n'Verification service unavailable' with 'Open Settings to resume Verify' and 'Continue without a verification'"
endgroup
group gNoAuth "No authorization required"
  process e6 "Beacon PPO with IOP or PHP: its rule on Payers says no authorization is needed\nStep 2 says so; steps 3 to 5 read Not applicable\nThree actions"
endgroup
group gDup "Possible duplicate"
  process e7 "Click 'Use sample chart' (J.M., 34, Summit, Residential 3.5) while R-1042 is open\nOr start a case for any patient who has an open request or an active authorization at the same payer and level of care"
endgroup
group gRetro "Retroactive with no payer rule"
  process e8 "Add a payer on Payers (for example Riverbend Health)\nPick it on a Retroactive authorization\n'No rule on file for Riverbend Health. Check with the payer.'"
endgroup
group gIds "Scripted member IDs"
  process e9 "Ending 9999 not found · 8080 known under another ID · 3030 service not covered · 5050 benefit not confirmed · 4040 clinic enrollment not confirmed · 2020 no authorization rule on file · 6060 another plan pays first"
endgroup
group gPortal "Verify cannot reach the portal"
  process e10 "A Cardinal case, the first time its agents run\n'Could not finish' on Verify, then Retry or 'Skip and note'"
endgroup
group gSite "Another site"
  process e11 "Open a link to a referral, a case or a patient at the site you cannot see\n'This referral is not available at Site A'"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Retroactive authorization"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Reauthorization / renewal"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Find a patient and the authorization"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Reauthorization / renewal"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Warnings and documented exceptions"
goto g6 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › No authorization required"
goto g7 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Possible duplicate"
goto g8 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Retroactive authorization"
goto g10 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › An agent could not finish"
goto g11 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Sites and scope"
goto gSet "Continues in: Settings › Pause › What the rest of the app shows"
goto gPay "Continues in: Payers › Add a payer"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Lapsed| e1 --> e1b --> g1
d1 -->|Ending| e2 --> g2
d1 -->|None left| e3 --> g3
d1 -->|Plan changed| e4 --> g4
d1 -->|Unavailable| e5 --> g5
e5 -.-> gSet
d1 -->|No authorization| e6 --> g6
d1 -->|Duplicate| e7 --> g7
d1 -->|Retro, no rule| e8 --> g8
e8 -.-> gPay
d1 -->|Scripted IDs| e9 --> g5
d1 -->|Portal| e10 --> g10
d1 -->|Other site| e11 --> g11
